<title>USA: Scoggin cuts Spreckels stake to 3.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Scoggin cuts Spreckels stake to 3.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoggin Capital Management LP said Thursday it reduced its stake in Spreckels Industries Inc to 3.7 percent or 233,333 class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commisssion, Scoggin said it sold a net of 190,000 shares of Spreckels between July 1 and August 26 at prices ranging from $15.50 to $23.571 a share.</p>
</text>
